{
  "schemaVersion": "1.1.0",
  "id": "alerting-query-language-set-evaluation-behavior",
  "title": "Set evaluation behavior",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Evaluation behavior sets how often Grafana runs your query, how long a problem must last before the alert fires, and how long the alert keeps firing after the condition resolves.\n\nIn this milestone, set the evaluation interval, pending period, and keep-firing period."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "set-evaluation-behavior",
      "title": "Set evaluation behavior",
      "requirements": [
        "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "#evaluate-every-no-group",
          "targetvalue": "1m",
          "content": "Set **Evaluation interval** to **1m**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "#eval-for-input",
          "targetvalue": "1m",
          "content": "Set **Pending period** to **1m**. Brief spikes get filtered out, but a real problem fires quickly.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "#keep-firing-for-input",
          "targetvalue": "0s",
          "content": "Set **Keep firing for** to **0s** so the alert stops firing when the condition resolves.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Your evaluation schedule is set. Next, you confirm no-data and error handling."
    }
  ]
}
